From a1908e2d84645bc7de8c0cbac41be928b215ae51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hemanth Kumar <hemanth@alifsemi.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Nov 2025 20:16:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] tensorflow-lite: Add support build for Cortex-A32

correct_sizeof_long_skip_unsupported_files.patch: Builds the XNNPACK twice.
The first build fails but after adding the fix
[disable_compiling_unsupported_arch_files_for_cortexa32.patch], the XNNPACK build pass.

Signed-off-by: Hemanth Kumar <hemanth@alifsemi.com>
---
